{
  "meta": {
    "id": "canon-episode-01",
    "version": 2,
    "mode": "anime-canon",
    "startNodeId": "canon_intro_001"
  },
  "nodes": {
    "canon_intro_001": {
      "id": "canon_intro_001",
      "type": "scene",
      "speaker": "system",
      "location": "light_bedroom",
      "text": [
        "Ryuk is bored in the Shinigami Realm. Light is bored in a rotten world.",
        "Two kinds of boredom collide when the Death Note falls into human hands."
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        { "type": "flag.set", "key": "found_notebook", "value": true },
        { "type": "milestone.complete", "milestoneId": "DEATH_NOTE_DISCOVERY" }
      ],
      "next": "canon_first_test_001"
    },
    "canon_first_test_001": {
      "id": "canon_first_test_001",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker": "light",
      "portrait": "light_focus",
      "location": "light_bedroom",
      "text": [
        "Light spends days doubting the notebook, then decides he alone can use it.",
        "Canon demands an early execution to begin Kira's global signal."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "follow_canon",
          "label": "Test the notebook on a televised criminal",
          "effects": [
            { "type": "stat.add", "path": "stats.intel", "value": 2 },
            { "type": "stat.add", "path": "stats.morality", "value": -3 },
            { "type": "flag.set", "key": "first_execution_done", "value": true },
            { "type": "milestone.complete", "milestoneId": "FIRST_EXECUTION_CONFIRMED" },
            { "type": "time.advance", "blocks": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "canon_tailor_trap_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "delay_execution",
          "label": "Delay and keep observing",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "gameover.trigger",
              "reason": "canon-failure",
              "detail": "Without the first execution, Kira's opening sequence never starts."
            }
          ],
          "next": "canon_failure_001"
        }
      ]
    },
    "canon_tailor_trap_001": {
      "id": "canon_tailor_trap_001",
      "type": "scene",
      "speaker": "l",
      "portrait": "l_stare",
      "location": "taskforce_hq",
      "text": [
        "L uses Lind L. Tailor as bait. Light kills instantly.",
        "L confirms Kira can kill remotely and narrows the region to Japan."
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        { "type": "flag.set", "key": "l_challenge_accepted", "value": true }
      ],
      "next": "canon_taskforce_entry_001"
    },
    "canon_taskforce_entry_001": {
      "id": "canon_taskforce_entry_001",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker": "system",
      "location": "taskforce_hq",
      "text": [
        "FBI shadows police families. L's suspicion starts focusing on Light.",
        "To monitor L directly, Light must embed himself near the investigation."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "join_taskforce",
          "label": "Join the task force orbit and stay close to L",
          "effects": [
            { "type": "flag.set", "key": "joined_taskforce", "value": true },
            { "type": "stat.add", "path": "stats.alibi", "value": 2 },
            { "type": "time.advance", "blocks": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "canon_surveillance_war_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "avoid_taskforce",
          "label": "Avoid direct contact with investigators",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "gameover.trigger",
              "reason": "canon-failure",
              "detail": "Light loses initiative by staying away from the investigation core."
            }
          ],
          "next": "canon_failure_001"
        }
      ]
    },
    "canon_surveillance_war_001": {
      "id": "canon_surveillance_war_001",
      "type": "choice",
      "speaker": "light",
      "portrait": "light_smirk",
      "location": "light_bedroom",
      "text": [
        "L places hidden cameras and wiretaps in Light's room.",
        "Light needs a deception layer that preserves both kills and cover."
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "potato_chip_plan",
          "label": "Use the potato-chip TV trick to fake normal study behavior",
          "effects": [
            { "type": "flag.set", "key": "surveillance_evaded", "value": true },
            { "type": "stat.add", "path": "stats.intel", "value": 1 },
            { "type": "stat.add", "path": "stats.alibi", "value": 1 },
            { "type": "suspicion.add", "value": -1, "reason": "surveillance_counterplay" },
            { "type": "milestone.complete", "milestoneId": "SURVEILLANCE_WAR_RESOLVED" },
            { "type": "time.advance", "blocks": 1 }
          ],
          "next": "canon_system_001"
        },
        {
          "id": "halt_kira_activity",
          "label": "Stop all notebook use during surveillance",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "gameover.trigger",
              "reason": "canon-failure",
              "detail": "The surveillance duel resolves incorrectly and L's model diverges from canon."
            }
          ],
          "next": "canon_failure_001"
        }
      ]
    },
    "canon_system_001": {
      "id": "canon_system_001",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": "system",
      "location": "taskforce_hq",
      "text": [
        "Arc I complete: Light and L are locked in open psychological war.",
        "Next arc: Raye Penber operation and escalation toward Misa."
      ],
      "next": null
    },
    "canon_failure_001": {
      "id": "canon_failure_001",
      "type": "system",
      "speaker": "system",
      "location": "taskforce_hq",
      "text": [
        "Timeline fracture detected.",
        "Anime canon collapsed."
      ],
      "next": null
    }
  }
}
